stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Requested
    Requested --> Rejected: Invalid pair, recipe, slot, costs or lock / consume nothing
    Requested --> Running: Accept once / consume costs and lock original parents
    Running --> Running: Persist or restore countdown under approved offline policy
    Running --> CompletedUnclaimed: Duration complete / release original parents once
    CompletedUnclaimed --> CompletedUnclaimed: Repeated completion / no repeated parent release
    CompletedUnclaimed --> Claimed: Claim once / create one new Rank I individual and receipt
    Claimed --> Claimed: Repeated claim or reload / same prior outcome
    Rejected --> [*]
    note right of Running
      Parents cannot deploy, produce, trade
      or enter another breeding job.
      Manual pause follows the shared timer policy.
    end note
